# No-tracking environment for a bashy-run klatch (shell-sourceable).
#
# klatch's server (net/server) has NO update checker and NO usage/telemetry
# reporting: reviewed at net/server/go.mod, the only outbound-capable
# dependency is github.com/SherClockHolmes/webpush-go, which the server uses
# to deliver browser push notifications to endpoints an ACCOUNT configures
# (a feature, not telemetry) — it makes no call of its own on startup or on
# any timer. The entire outbound surface this file guards against is
# therefore an inherited proxy, not klatch's own code.
#
# Usage: set -a; . bashy-build/no-tracking.env; set +a

# No inherited proxy may route klatch traffic off this host.
HTTP_PROXY=
HTTPS_PROXY=
ALL_PROXY=
http_proxy=
https_proxy=
all_proxy=
NO_PROXY=127.0.0.1,::1,localhost
no_proxy=127.0.0.1,::1,localhost
